OL,3,GNEWSANo compulsory redundancies from
OL,4,Ahealth board cuts - Swinney
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwinney told the programme: "I will
OL,7,Fmaintain the no compulsory redundancy
OL,8,Fcommitment. There is no question about
OL,9,Fthat in my mind."
